Wuiyeb
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 33 DEAL {GARU, COLUMN, UWOUT}
UWOUT 10 FACE_LAST
UWOUT 5 FACE_HALF

COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

GARU 7 FACE_HALF
GARU 0 FACE_HALF

BAEM 5 FACE_ALL

IYO 9 FACE_HALF
IYO 10 FACE_HALF
IYO 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IYO 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IYO 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN GARU
AND
    AND
        DEST Size == 5
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
    OR
        SRC Rank 1
        DEST Size == 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL IYO Empty
        PILE ALL BAEM Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IYO Empty
        PILE ALL IYO Empty
